<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3371300301"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1894215797"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="NEXT CARD"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="AiScReam"/><amll:meta key="album" value="NEXT CARD"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:12.914"><div begin="00:02.517" end="03:10.584"><p begin="00:02.517" end="00:08.936" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">Yeah!, AiScReam, NEXT CARD, "Battle Start"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没错 AiScReam 亮出下张卡牌“战斗开始”</span></p><p begin="00:11.155" end="00:13.827" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">SCREAM 愛 SCREAM 愛<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大声喊出爱 大声喊出爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Scream a i scream a i</span></p><p begin="00:13.827" end="00:16.650" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">SCREAM 愛 SCREAM 愛<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大声喊出爱 大声喊出爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Scream a i scream a i</span></p><p begin="00:16.650" end="00:19.480" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">SCREAM 愛 SCREAM 愛<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大声喊出爱 大声喊出爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Scream a i scream a i</span></p><p begin="00:19.480" end="00:22.727" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">SCREAM 愛 SCREAM!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大声喊出爱 大声喊出</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Scream a i scream</span></p><p begin="00:22.727" end="00:24.845" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">ファーストカード イニシャルはC<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">第一张卡牌 首字母是C</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fa a su to ka a do i ni sha ru ha C</span></p><p begin="00:25.777" end="00:28.575" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">操るこのフィンガリング<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">指尖动作是如此娴熟</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ya tsu ru ko no fi n ga ri n gu</span></p><p begin="00:28.575" end="00:33.385" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">君の心はノーガード バレバレだよ次切るそのカード<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的心毫无设防</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no ko ko ro ha no o ga a do</span></p><p begin="00:34.148" end="00:39.286" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">表裏ナシ このおもてなし 論理的には私に敵ナシ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毫无保留坦诚相待</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo te u ra na shi ko no o mo te na shi</span></p><p begin="00:39.608" end="00:44.949" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">イニシャルM ねぇ、気になるでしょ？ プログラミングもバグらすミッション<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">首字母是M</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ni sha ru M</span></p><p begin="00:45.250" end="00:48.026" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">(チェッ CHECK そろそろFinal Call)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(检查一番 该作出最终确认了)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">che ' check so ro so ro final call</span></p><p begin="00:48.026" end="00:50.634" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">イニシャルS 私も行きます！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">首字母是S 我也来加入</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ni sha ru S wa ta shi mo i ki ma su</span></p><p begin="00:50.846" end="00:53.653" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">(チョッ ちょっと 待ったCallです)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(那个 稍等 先暂停一下)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">cho ' cho 't to ma 't ta call de su</span></p><p begin="00:53.653" end="00:59.017" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">イニシャルAだよ「みんなー！ 誰が好き!?」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">首字母是A哦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ni sha ru A da yo</span></p><p begin="00:59.017" end="01:01.823" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">SCREAM 愛 SCREAM 愛<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大声喊出爱 大声喊出爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Scream a i scream a i</span></p><p begin="01:01.823" end="01:04.655" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">SCREAM 愛 SCREAM 愛<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大声喊出爱 大声喊出爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Scream a i scream a i</span></p><p begin="01:04.655" end="01:07.428" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">SCREAM 愛 SCREAM 愛<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大声喊出爱 大声喊出爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Scream a i scream a i</span></p><p begin="01:07.428" end="01:10.654" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">SCREAM 愛 SCREAM!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大声喊出爱 大声喊出</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Scream a i scream</span></p><p begin="01:10.654" end="01:13.213" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">曖昧な態度ヤ・メ・テ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">态度别再那么模棱两可</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ma i na ta i do ya me te</span></p><p begin="01:13.213" end="01:15.965" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">ココはひとつ私にキ・メ・テ！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">趁此机会干脆就选定我吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ha hi to tsu wa ta shi ni ki me te</span></p><p begin="01:15.965" end="01:18.760" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">NEXT CARD NEXT CARD<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">下张卡牌 下张卡牌</span></p><p begin="01:18.760" end="01:21.919" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">ほら次々 もう止まらない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你看 接连不断 根本停不下来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ra tsu gi tsu gi mo u to ma ra na i</span></p><p begin="01:21.919" end="01:27.580" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">「愛の手札で君を落とすよ」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“就用爱的手牌将你虏获吧”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 a i no te fu da de ki mi wo o to su yo 」</span></p><p begin="01:27.580" end="01:33.264" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">なんて言えたら良いのにな でも実際さ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多么希望我可以这么说啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n te i e ta ra i i no ni na</span></p><p begin="01:33.264" end="01:38.769" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">ライバル達に負けたくないよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我根本不愿输给那些竞争对手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ra i ba ru ta chi ni ma ke ta ku na i yo</span></p><p begin="01:38.896" end="01:44.971" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">「誰を選ぶの？」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“你要选择谁?”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 da re wo e ra bu no ?」</span></p><p begin="01:50.322" end="01:51.849" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">歩夢だぴょん<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就是步梦 喜欢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a yu mu da pyo n su ki</span></p><p begin="01:53.724" end="01:55.527" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">好き<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喜欢你</span></p><p begin="01:58.634" end="02:01.186" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">I! 麻衣！みー！マイン<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">麻衣 就要做自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I ma i mi i ma i n</span></p><p begin="02:01.560" end="02:03.459" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">せっちゃんのLOVE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">赛酱的爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se 'c cha n no love</span></p><p begin="02:08.586" end="02:10.936" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">(チェッ CHECK そろそろFinal Call)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(检查一番 该作出最终确认了)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">che ' check so ro so ro final call</span></p><p begin="02:10.936" end="02:14.166" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">ねぇ、、、優柔不断は嫌われちゃうぞ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 优柔寡断会被讨厌哦?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne yu u ju u fu da n ha ki ra wa re cha u zo ?</span></p><p begin="02:14.166" end="02:17.036" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">(チョッ ちょっと 待ったCallです)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(那个 稍等 先暂停一下)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">cho ' cho 't to ma 't ta call de su</span></p><p begin="02:17.036" end="02:22.661" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">最後だよ「みんなー！ 誰が好き!?」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最后一次啦“大家ー 都喜欢谁?”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa i go da yo 「 mi n na a da re ga su ki ?」</span></p><p begin="02:22.661" end="02:24.369" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">「誰が好き!?」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“都喜欢谁?”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 da re ga su ki ?」</span></p><p begin="02:24.369" end="02:25.967" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">Let's Go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">开始吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Scream a i scream a i</span></p><p begin="02:25.067" end="02:27.938" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">SCREAM 愛 SCREAM 愛<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大声喊出爱 大声喊出爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Scream a i scream a i</span></p><p begin="02:27.938" end="02:30.816" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">SCREAM 愛 SCREAM 愛<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大声喊出爱 大声喊出爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Scream a i scream a i</span></p><p begin="02:30.816" end="02:33.618" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">SCREAM 愛 SCREAM 愛<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大声喊出爱 大声喊出爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Scream a i scream a i</span></p><p begin="02:33.618" end="02:36.784" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">SCREAM 愛 SCREAM!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大声喊出爱 大声喊出</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Scream a i scream</span></p><p begin="02:36.784" end="02:39.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">曖昧な態度ヤ・メ・テ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">态度别再那么模棱两可</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ma i na ta i do ya me te</span></p><p begin="02:39.210" end="02:42.093" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">ココはひとつ私にキ・メ・テ！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">趁此机会干脆就选定我吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ha hi to tsu wa ta shi ni ki me te</span></p><p begin="02:42.093" end="02:44.845" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">NEXT CARD NEXT CARD<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">下张卡牌 下张卡牌</span></p><p begin="02:44.845" end="02:47.782" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">ほらズキンッズキンッ もう止まらない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你看 心中感到悸动难耐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ra zu ki n 'z zu ki n '</span></p><p begin="02:47.782" end="02:50.539" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">SCREAM 愛 SCREAM 愛<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大声喊出爱 大声喊出爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Scream a i scream a i</span></p><p begin="02:50.539" end="02:53.344" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">SCREAM 愛 SCREAM 愛<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大声喊出爱 大声喊出爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Scream a i scream a i</span></p><p begin="02:53.344" end="02:56.204" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">SCREAM 愛 SCREAM 愛<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大声喊出爱 大声喊出爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Scream a i scream a i</span></p><p begin="02:56.204" end="02:58.985" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">SCREAM 愛 SCREAM!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大声喊出爱 大声喊出</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Scream a i scream</span></p><p begin="02:58.985" end="03:01.861" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">SCREAM 愛 SCREAM 愛<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大声喊出爱 大声喊出爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Scream a i scream a i</span></p><p begin="03:01.957" end="03:04.610" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">SCREAM 愛 SCREAM 愛<span ttm:role="x-translati